
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, code, saved checkpoints, experiment scripts, or LAADAN-AC implementation, please cite this work."
title: "LAADAN-AC: Beyond Survival in Admissible Offline Treatment-Policy Learning"
type: software
authors:
