    given-names: "Riya"
    affiliation: "University of Hertfordshire"
  - family-names: "Helal"
    given-names: "Manal"
    affiliation: "University of Hertfordshire"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnnyaB/laadan-ac"
url: "https://github.com/AnnyaB/laadan-ac"
date-released: "2026-06-01"
license: "MIT"
abstract: "LAADAN-AC is a research codebase for admissibility-aware offline reinforcement learning in sepsis treatment-policy benchmarks. It implements Lagrangian Admissibility-Aware Deep Action-Nudging Actor-Critic with hard admissibility masking, twin reward critics, conservative critic regularisation, expert-policy regularisation, a state-action smoothness proxy, and Lagrangian cost control. The repository includes experiments on ICU-Sepsis and a constructed eICU-CRD Demo Markov decision process."
keywords:
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - safe reinforcement learning
  - ICU-Sepsis
  - sepsis treatment
  - admissibility masking
  - actor-critic
  - Lagrangian cost control
  - clinical decision support

